        <mxCell id="lg" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cubes are devices; dashed boxes are execution environments; blue boxes are programs; yellow notes are build artifacts; grey notes are files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The desktop app runs fully offline on one machine. The CLIs run where the data is and produce files that are copied to the analyst machine and opened in IMT. The check job runs on ubuntu-latest; the bundle job runs on all three runner OSes; the release job (v* tags) uploads the installers to a Gitea release." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
